 ],
 "description": "First 24 SE is a modern high-tech sport cruiser, delivering thrilling performance and an exciting sailing experience. Easy trailability enables competing on international one-design windward-leeward regattas or coastal adventure races. And just after the race, she will welcome you with a basic but smart interior, offering all basic cruising amenities for four persons. No matter the mode, she is a pure sailing sensation.\nConcept & R&D: Seascape",
